{#
    One "Add to comparison" / "Remove from comparison" button (docs/features/player-comparison.md, D11): a POST that
    comes back to this page with a flash. Signed-in viewers only - guests get a sign-in link instead. The token is
    stateless (config/packages/csrf.php), so the page stays session-free. No ids: the player header's ⋯ menu renders twice.
    A one-tap link, never a form (GEST-15, decision 99: the pages it sits on may be restored from Turbo's cache) -
    post_action_controller.js posts it, without JavaScript it opens the confirmation view (PostAction::CompareAdd/Remove).

    Inputs:
      - action: 'add' | 'remove'
      - subject: ComparisonSubjectRef::toString() ("p-<uuid>", "t-<uuid>")
      - label: what the button does
      - button_class, form_class (optional), icon (bootstrap icon class)
      - icon_only (bool, optional): the label goes into aria-label and title instead
      - new_badge (bool, optional): the "New" badge - after the label, or on the icon's top edge when icon_only
      - nav (string, optional): the button's data-nav id (P0-03) where the form sits in a navigation container (the card)
    The player card keeps the POST form itself (comparison_entry/_subject_post_form.html.twig, same inputs): its frame posts
    it and answers inside the card.
#}
{%- set icon_only = icon_only|default(false) -%}
{%- set link -%}
<a {{ post_action_attributes(action == 'add' ? 'compare_add' : 'compare_remove', {}, {subject: subject, return: app.request.requestUri}) }} class="{{ button_class }}"{% if icon_only %} aria-label="{{ label }}" title="{{ label }}"{% endif %}{% if nav|default(null) %} data-nav="{{ nav }}"{% endif %}>
    <i class="bi {{ icon }}{{ icon_only ? '' : ' me-1' }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>{% if not icon_only %} {{ label }}{% endif %}
    {%- if new_badge|default(false) %}{{ include('comparison_entry/_new_badge.html.twig', {on_icon: icon_only}) }}{% endif %}
</a>
{%- endset -%}
{% if form_class|default(null) %}<div class="{{ form_class }}">{{ link }}</div>{% else %}{{ link }}{% endif %}
